093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§8.1, Definition 8.1 and Theorem 8.2, pp.125–126, DjVu scans 140–141"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书存在一元二阶前缀及量词秩限制已比对；以下为本库的显式片段与相对查询接口"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。结构有限非空；关系词汇可含常量。</li>\n<li>关系变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^1\">\\(X_i^1\\)</span>、矩阵片段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_1\\)</span> 和量词块取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\tau,i}\">\\(P_{\\tau,i}\\)</span> 是下式选取的新一元词汇符号，不是关系变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^1\">\\(X_i^1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_c\">\\(\\tau_c\\)</span> 只用于着色结构的词汇。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为唯一见证定描述符。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar C_c\\coloneqq(X_0^1,\\ldots,X_{c-1}^1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar C_c\\coloneqq(X_0^1,\\ldots,X_{c-1}^1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_{\\tau,i}\\coloneqq\\iota P\\in\\mathsf R\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ar}(P)=1\\land P\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,j}:j&lt;i\\}\\land\\nu(P)=\\min\\{\\nu(Q)\\mid Q\\in\\mathsf R,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(Q)=1,\\ Q\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,j}:j&lt;i\\}\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_{\\tau,i}\\coloneqq\\iota P\\in\\mathsf R\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ar}(P)=1\\land P\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,j}:j&lt;i\\}\\land\\nu(P)=\\min\\{\\nu(Q)\\mid Q\\in\\mathsf R,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(Q)=1,\\ Q\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,j}:j&lt;i\\}\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar P_{\\tau,c}\\coloneqq(P_{\\tau,0},\\ldots,P_{\\tau,c-1}),\\qquad\\tau_c\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar P_{\\tau,c}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar P_{\\tau,c}\\coloneqq(P_{\\tau,0},\\ldots,P_{\\tau,c-1}),\\qquad\\tau_c\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar P_{\\tau,c}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\exists\\bar C_c)\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar C_c)],\\ \\operatorname{fv}_1(\\varphi)=\\varnothing,\\ \\mathrm{qr}_1(\\varphi)\\leq m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\exists\\bar C_c)\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar C_c)],\\ \\operatorname{fv}_1(\\varphi)=\\varnothing,\\ \\mathrm{qr}_1(\\varphi)\\leq m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K]\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{\\{A\\in K\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\}\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1[\\tau]\\bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K]\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{\\{A\\in K\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\}\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1[\\tau]\\bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §8.1 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO}\\exists(\\mathrm{monadic})\">\\(\\mathrm{SO}\\exists(\\mathrm{monadic})\\)</span>；本条把有限个一元存在关系量词、指定自由关系变量的一阶矩阵及模型类分别显式化。已核对印刷页125–126（扫描页140–141），并查看扫描页141图像确认 Theorem 8.2 的方向和量词秩条件。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 表示存在一元二阶，不能与任意元数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^1\">\\(\\Sigma_1^1\\)</span> 混用，也不能与词上的全部 MSO 混用。</p>\n<p>规范关系变量名只固定语法代表；任何有限一元前缀均可先作束缚变量换名。允许空前缀包含 FO。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\geq1\">\\(m\\geq1\\)</span> 不漏掉量词秩零的句子，因为它们已在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=1\">\\(m=1\\)</span> 片段中。相对论域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 单独作为查询类参数；其中不会自动加入序、BIT 或其他数值关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-second-order]]","e