\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K]\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{\\{A\\in K\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\}\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1[\\tau]\\bigr\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SO}\\exists(\\mathrm{monadic})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"m=1","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":3464,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-eso]]、[[29-df-monadic-so-game]]、[[29-thm-monadic-so-game]] — 一元存在二阶片段及着色游戏的单向保真"},{"id":"fa169cf9db0afb60","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\bar C_c,\\tau_c$ 见 [[29-df-monadic-eso]]；$\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c$，$\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c$。$\\iota$ 为存在唯一见证时的定描述符，$A'\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau$ 为结构约化。"},{"id":"93bcfaaefa338233","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"688ab84b1bfdaffd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_0=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle$，$\\tau_1=\\langle E^{(2)},<^{(2)}\\rangle$；输入均为有限非空结构；$\\mathrm{STRUC}$ 见 [[29-df-struc]]。一元关系变量 $X_0^1$、$\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}$ 及相对查询类见 [[29-df-monadic-eso]]。"},{"id":"75c22d8e0af45459","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-monadic-eso]]"}],"outgoing":["4db9fd38055efd65","711217f22972ffc0","5a04c13fd73e2c1c","8372f1f6b9135d87","44836019093a45c6","4de8e0c8085801f5","28e86a5f0243a0ae"]}